<title>UK: P&amp;O gives back gains from Eurotunnel fire.</title>
<headline>P&amp;O gives back gains from Eurotunnel fire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in P&amp;O sank, giving back gains sustained after news of a fire earlier this week in the undersea Channel Tunnel link between France and Britain.</p>
<p>By 1053 GMT, P&amp;O shares were down 10-1/2p to 597p.</p>
<p>The shares, said one market maker, &quot;had a run-up after the Eurotunnel fire and now they've just retraced back to where they should be.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
